  "description": "<p>This is the web map component used in NCEI's&nbsp;<a target='_blank' href='https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/maps/hazards/' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Natural Hazards Data Viewer<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/p><div>Included are layers for Historical Tsunami Events, Tsunami Observations, Significant Earthquakes, Significant Volcanic Events, Volcano Locations, Current DARTs and Retrospective BPR Deployments, Historical Tsunami Marigrams, Tsunami-Capable Tide Stations, Plate Boundaries, Modeled Tsunami Travel Time Contours, and Tsunami Energy Plots for Selected Events.<\/div>",
